{"title":"News","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"News","page-layout":"full"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>News &amp; <span class=\"wheat-accent\">Events</span></h1>\n    <p>Updates from the EC² Lab: publications, awards, grants, talks, and recruiting.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"container page-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"row g-5\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Latest News</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Mar</div><div class=\"news-month\">2026</div></div><div><span class=\"tag\">Publication</span><h5>New paper accepted in <em>Journal of Chemical Education</em></h5><p>\"Interdisciplinary Pedagogy for Environmental Chemistry Communication Through Art-Engineering Collaboration\" was accepted in March 2026.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Mar</div><div class=\"news-month\">2026</div></div><div><span class=\"tag tag-purple\">Grant</span><h5>USDA ARS award for 3D-printed PFAS adsorbents</h5><p>Dr. Choudhary is PI on a $66,000 accepted project, \"Graphene-Based Microwave-Regenerable 3D-Printed Adsorbents for PFAS Removal from Agricultural Waters.\"</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Oct</div><div class=\"news-month\">2025</div></div><div><span class=\"tag\">Invited Talk</span><h5>Invited research talk at Towson University</h5><p>Dr. Choudhary presented \"Bridging Disciplines for a Cleaner and Sustainable Future: A Journey from Chemical Engineering to Environmental Solutions.\"</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Jul</div><div class=\"news-month\">2025</div></div><div><span class=\"tag tag-green\">Award</span><h5>Trailblazers in Engineering Fellow at Purdue University</h5><p>Dr. Choudhary was selected as a 2025 TBE Fellow by Purdue University's College of Engineering.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Jun</div><div class=\"news-month\">2025</div></div><div><span class=\"tag\">Conference</span><h5>Invited oral presentation at Gordon Research Seminar</h5><p>She presented work on oxidation of graphene, π-electron conjugation, and microwave reactivity in environmental nanotechnology.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Dec</div><div class=\"news-month\">2024</div></div><div><span class=\"tag\">Award</span><h5>Best Poster Award at NSF Nanoscale Science and Engineering Grantees Conference</h5><p>A poster co-authored with Dr. Choudhary on microwave heating of superparamagnetic iron-oxide nanoparticles received Best Poster recognition.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">2024</div><div class=\"news-month\">Award</div></div><div><span class=\"tag tag-green\">Recognition</span><h5>AAEES 40 Under 40 Rising Star</h5><p>Dr. Choudhary was honored in the American Academy of Environmental Engineers and Scientists Class of 2024.</p></div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Upcoming</h2>\n      <div class=\"calendar-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"calendar-placeholder\">\n          <h5>Lab Calendar Coming Soon</h5>\n          <p>The EC² Lab calendar will include seminar dates, recruitment events, student deadlines, and public-facing outreach activities.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"info-panel mt-4\">\n        <h5>Recruiting</h5>\n        <p>Graduate and undergraduate research opportunities are planned for students interested in PFAS remediation, plasma treatment, water reuse, and circular adsorbent regeneration.</p>\n        <a href=\"join.qmd\" class=\"btn-earth\">See Openings</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>News &amp; <span class=\"wheat-accent\">Events</span></h1>\n    <p>Updates from the EC² Lab: publications, awards, grants, talks, and recruiting.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"container page-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"row g-5\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Latest News</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Mar</div><div class=\"news-month\">2026</div></div><div><span class=\"tag\">Publication</span><h5>New paper accepted in <em>Journal of Chemical Education</em></h5><p>\"Interdisciplinary Pedagogy for Environmental Chemistry Communication Through Art-Engineering Collaboration\" was accepted in March 2026.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Mar</div><div class=\"news-month\">2026</div></div><div><span class=\"tag tag-purple\">Grant</span><h5>USDA ARS award for 3D-printed PFAS adsorbents</h5><p>Dr. Choudhary is PI on a $66,000 accepted project, \"Graphene-Based Microwave-Regenerable 3D-Printed Adsorbents for PFAS Removal from Agricultural Waters.\"</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Oct</div><div class=\"news-month\">2025</div></div><div><span class=\"tag\">Invited Talk</span><h5>Invited research talk at Towson University</h5><p>Dr. Choudhary presented \"Bridging Disciplines for a Cleaner and Sustainable Future: A Journey from Chemical Engineering to Environmental Solutions.\"</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><div class=\"news-date-block\"><div class=\"news-day\">Jul</div><div class=\"news-month\">2025</div></div><div><span class=\"tag tag-green\">Award</span><h5>Trailblazers in Engineering Fellow at Purdue University</h5><p>Dr. Choudhary was selected as a 2025 TBE 